  "notes": "Official 2024-2025 BCCC catalog program page (\"Program: Business, Marketing Area of Concentration, AAS\", printed Program Total 60). Structured as a career program for entry-level marketing trainee positions (business, industry, government, service fields); entrepreneurship also a career option. Accredited by the Association of Collegiate Business Schools and Programs (ACBSP). Catalog advises that some specialized Marketing Concentration courses may not transfer to some four-year colleges, and transfer-oriented students should take the Business Administration Transfer Program. 0-credit Computer Literacy requirement documented here only. BCCC's 2025-2026 catalog program pages were unreachable via research tools (Academic Programs index requires JS; search/sitemap endpoints 403), so 2024-2025 remains the latest machine-readable official catalog.",
